# Where the axis stands: left of the plot or right of it; its foot and its top (the other way round when inverted).
@cfx.ap.a ui.diagram.yaxis group=?g side=?side
@cfx.ap.b ui.diagram.ubox unit=?g x0=?x y0=?y w=?w
